CrossTaint

This distribution is derived from the public fuondai/xtain repository at
commit 320883a61888ba7a92a6ad738d951a7dcc7ffd23:

    https://github.com/fuondai/xtain/tree/320883a61888ba7a92a6ad738d951a7dcc7ffd23

The following submission-hardening modifications were released on
2026-08-01 as the derived v1.1.0 release at:

    https://github.com/dungtran183/xtain

- complete Apache License 2.0 and upstream provenance metadata;
- citation, release-inventory, and project metadata;
- packaged default configuration and clearer configuration errors;
- offline artifact validation, benchmark schemas, synthetic smoke data,
  deterministic tests, and continuous integration;
- reproducibility documentation and responsible-use clarification; and
- import-path hardening that does not change scientific algorithms or
  reported results.

Modified upstream Python files carry a v1.1.0 change notice in their module
documentation: `__init__.py`, `config.py`, `experiments/__init__.py`,
`experiments/corpus.py`, and `propagation/weight.py`.

